package skill

// One shared explanation of a result section, not another query view or a
// new causal admission rule. Keep field names tied to the native DTO.
const TraceBusinessTreeTeaching = "For nested business work use view=\"window_stats\" and read business_tree (a result section, not a view). It inventories all emitters in begin-line order, not target-filtered or duration-ranked Top work. Its node IDs and parent_id preserve observed same-source, same-thread synchronous B/E instances, not name matching or cross-thread time containment. inclusive.duration_ms is query-clipped wall time; self.duration_ms removes the union of direct children before display limits. Parent/child inclusive times must not be added; self can contain several disjoint segments. Read closure, parent_status, coverage and omitted counts at each handoff: missing rows/ancestors are not roots, incomplete spans have no invented cost, and absent state values mean unavailable, not zero. A nonempty window_unavailable_reason means the query's continuous time window is undetermined; use each node's own segments, not placeholder query endpoints. State values intersect the owner's inclusive/self segments; unknown_ms is unmeasured time, and sleep_io_wait_ms is included in sleep_ms. Use business wording such as 业务层级、片段总耗时、自身耗时. This is neither a complete call graph nor a wakeup/root-cause tree; combine independently qualified thread/wakeup evidence for response-impact analysis."
